* MIM = cap_mim_2f0_m4m5_noshield (terminal 1 = top plate, 2 = bottom plate, NOT interchangeable in LVS); all sizes are numbers; no ideal element.
* File adc_ch.spice: the ADC analog part of one channel (L1).  Cells: dac_sw (split 6+6 MIM DAC, 13 drivers on vdd_dac, 13 sampling TGs, 2 reset switches), cmp_p (on vdd_cmp),
* vhalf, vrefs (Cref switch + Cref), the INV standard cell (samb), and adc_ch = their wiring in module afe_ch of AFE/top/dbs_afe_top.v (vin = the net amp_out of afe_ch).
* Supply pins of adc_ch (AUDIT 4.9.2): vdd = analog strap (vhalf, Cref switch, inverter, sampling-TG n-wells); vdd_cmp = ADC-main strap; vdd_dac = ADC-DAC strap; one vss.

